@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-16 - Manage User Profile

actor "User" as Actor
boundary "Auth / Profile UI" as FE
control "AuthController" as API
control "UsersService" as Service
database "MongoDB: users, role" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-16
FE -> API: GET/PATCH /auth/users/:id/profile
API -> Service: Execute Manage User Profile
Service -> DB: Read/write users, role
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Profile được cập nhật

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Phone không hợp lệ -> validation error
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập
Post: Profile được cập nhật
Main flow:
1. User vào trang /profile
2. System hiển thị thông tin: username, email, fullName, phone, avatar
3. User chỉnh sửa fullName, phone
4. System gọi API PUT /auth/profile
5. System cập nhật DB
end note
@enduml
